usage: plan.py unlink [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] --kind
                      {depends_on,related,decision,applies_to,unit_depends_on}
                      [--relation RELATION]
                      plan from to

remove a typed link between two documents of the plan; a missing link is a no-
op

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  from
  to

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --kind {depends_on,related,decision,applies_to,unit_depends_on}
  --relation RELATION   related only: the relation of the link to remove
